#. module: payment_hapipay
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_hapipay.field_payment_provider__hapipay_api_key
msgid ""
"Created in your HapiPay space, Developers > API keys. An hpc_test_ key "
"simulates payments; an hpc_ key collects real money."
msgstr ""
"Créée dans votre espace HapiPay, menu Développeurs > Clés d'API. Une clé "
"hpc_test_ simule les paiements ; une clé hpc_ encaisse pour de vrai."

#. module: payment_hapipay
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_hapipay.selection__payment_provider__code__hapipay
#: model:payment.provider,name:payment_hapipay.payment_provider_hapipay
